[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6911.589, "timestamp": "01:55:11", "text": "[清嗓子]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6920.07, "timestamp": "01:55:20", "text": "嗯，我可以在那里编辑和发布。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6929.669, "timestamp": "01:55:29", "text": "我决定制作的原因是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6933.43, "timestamp": "01:55:33", "text": "我自己专门设置了一个24小时不间断播放音乐的频道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6935.669, "timestamp": "01:55:35", "text": "这是因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6939.43, "timestamp": "01:55:39", "text": "对于那些不了解我的人来说，我将是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6941.43, "timestamp": "01:55:41", "text": "离开"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6944.149, "timestamp": "01:55:44", "text": "呃，对于那些不知道的人来说，我将是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6949.35, "timestamp": "01:55:49", "text": "2026年4月前前往日本。 修正。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6954.229, "timestamp": "01:55:54", "text": "所以这意味着它会保持开放状态"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6956.149, "timestamp": "01:55:56", "text": "不可预测的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6959.109, "timestamp": "01:55:59", "text": "对我来说，这扇门就像我不知道什么时候会打开一样"}]